      "slug": "morning-routine",
      "title": "A Simple Morning Routine",
      "level": "A2",
      "body": "I wake up early and keep a quiet morning routine. First I stretch for a few minutes. Then I open my notebook and review five words. Small steps still mean progress. After that I make coffee and plan the day.",
      "wordLemmas": ["routine", "quiet", "stretch", "notebook", "review", "progress", "habit", "focus"]
    },
